sample_context:
Skillz.setDesc(12,1,"Combat is the skill that allows you to endure prolonged fights by enhancing your energy recovery.

Each attack has a base 10% chance, plus 1% per skill point, to restore 15 energy.

");

Skillz.setDesc(14,1,"Poisoning is the art of mastering toxins through self-experimentation, transforming suffering into vitality. Higher skill levels increase your energy regeneration.

Each attack deals bonus water damage equal to 0.1% of the target's HP per skill point.

");

Skillz.setDesc(13,1,"Subtlety manipulates the boundary between life and death, granting you energy upon killing enemies and increasing your speed.

Energy consuming attack grants 1 stack, which increase your attack speed by 1% per skill point in Subtlety. Stacks up to 5 times.

");
